## Class Naming

| Type | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Domain Service | `{Entity}Service` | `UserService` |
| Infrastructure Provider | `{Entity}Provider` | `UserProvider` |
| Cache Provider | `{Entity}CacheProvider` | `UserCacheProvider` |
| DTO Model | `{Entity}` | `User` |
| Request model | `{Action}{Entity}Request` | `CreateUserRequest` |
| Response model | `{Action}{Entity}Response` | `CreateUserResponse` |

---

## Interface Naming

All interfaces MUST start with `I`.

```
✅ IUserService  IUserProvider  ICacheUserService
❌ UserServiceInterface  UserServiceIface
```

---

## Method Naming

| Scope | Convention | Example |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Public | PascalCase | `GetUser`, `CreateOrder`, `DeleteProduct` |
| Private | camelCase | `getUser`, `createOrder`, `deleteProduct` |

```csharp
// Correct
public Task<User> GetUser(int userId) { ... }
private void validateInput(CreateUserRequest request) { ... }

// Wrong — private method using PascalCase
private void ValidateInput(CreateUserRequest request) { ... }
```

---

## Legacy Code vs New Code

`naming.mdc` overrides same-file / same-module legacy style. See `./aidata/csharp/.cursor_rules` Priority Order.

| Situation | Rule |
|-----------|------|
| **New** private method or field | MUST use camelCase / `_camelCase` — do not copy PascalCase private methods from neighbors |
| **Modify** existing PascalCase private method | SHOULD rename to camelCase in the same change |
| **Untouched** legacy PascalCase private code | May remain until that method is edited; do not use as a template for new code |

```csharp
// Legacy in file (do not copy for new methods)
private async Task LoadDataAsync() { ... }

// ✅ New private method in same file — still camelCase
private async Task loadMasterLeagueNameMapsAsync() { ... }

// ❌ Wrong — mimicking legacy PascalCase for new code
private async Task LoadMasterLeagueNameMapsAsync() { ... }
```

---

## Private Field Naming

Use underscore + camelCase.

```
✅ _userService   _userProvider   _kafkaLogger
❌ _user_Service  _user_Provider  _UserService
```

---

## Parameters and Local Variables

Use camelCase. No underscores.

```
✅ userId   request   gameInfo   cancellationToken
❌ user_Id  game_Info  User_Id
```

