## Route Naming

Routes MUST use camelCase. MUST NOT use snake-case or kebab-case.

Route segment 中的縮寫（如 AI、API、DB、ID）必須轉成小寫連續字，不能用 `-` 拆字，也不要保留全大寫；例如 AI Merge 應寫成 `aimerge`，不是 `ai-merge` 或 `AIMerge`。

```csharp
// Correct
[HttpGet("getUserById")]
[HttpPost("createUser")]
[HttpPut("updateUserProfile")]
[HttpGet("aimerge/backtest/{gameType}/latest")]

// Wrong
[HttpGet("get-user-by-id")]
[HttpPost("create_user")]
[HttpPut("update-user-profile")]
[HttpGet("ai-merge/backtest/{gameType}/latest")]
[HttpGet("AIMerge/backtest/{gameType}/latest")]
```
